# Running Tests

pytest is installed and the suite is written for it (fixtures, `parametrize`,
`pytest.raises`). Run it as a module so it picks up `pytest.ini`:

```bash
# the whole suite
uv run python -m pytest dagnabbit -q

# one file
uv run python -m pytest dagnabbit/dag/tests/test_canonical.py -q

# skip anything marked slow
uv run python -m pytest dagnabbit -q -m "not slow"
```
